WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.374 --> 00:00:03.257
Unit thirteen. Vaccines!

2
00:00:04.233 --> 00:00:07.810
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:07.860 --> 00:00:10.971
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.021 --> 00:00:14.248
Today we learn about Vaccines. Let's go!

5
00:00:15.534 --> 00:00:19.167
Vaccine. Say it with me. Vaccine!

6
00:00:22.667 --> 00:00:26.800
Immune system. Say it with me. Immune system!

7
00:00:30.297 --> 00:00:34.080
Disease. Say it with me. Disease!

8
00:00:37.587 --> 00:00:40.954
Protect. Say it with me. Protect!

9
00:00:44.447 --> 00:00:48.397
Injection. Say it with me. Injection!

10
00:00:51.880 --> 00:00:55.647
Community. Say it with me. Community!

11
00:00:59.166 --> 00:01:03.216
Health worker. Say it with me. Health worker!

12
00:01:06.717 --> 00:01:10.434
Record. Say it with me. Record!

13
00:01:13.935 --> 00:01:24.221
A vaccine trains the immune system to fight a disease. Most are given by injection from a health worker. Vaccines protect me and my community, and my record shows which ones I have had.

14
00:01:24.271 --> 00:01:25.433
I can do that too!

15
00:01:26.878 --> 00:01:31.840
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:31.890 --> 00:01:33.040
Disease!

17
00:01:34.038 --> 00:01:39.455
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:39.505 --> 00:01:40.851
Health worker!

19
00:01:41.759 --> 00:01:47.141
Did you know? Vaccines helped the world completely get rid of smallpox!

20
00:01:47.191 --> 00:01:49.233
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:49.926 --> 00:01:58.060
Think and answer. How do vaccines protect a whole community?

22
00:01:58.110 --> 00:01:59.260
Great answer!

23
00:02:00.328 --> 00:02:05.003
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:05.053 --> 00:02:07.636
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

